miliar straw-stuffed figures. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/01/travel/england-scarecrow-festival.html', 'snippet': 'If you happen to be in Yorkshire for the Kettlewell Scarecrow Festival this August, don’t be surprised if you run into a few familiar straw-stuffed figures. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'As an airline pilot and writer, I’ve been all around the world — to the skyscraper-forests of Shanghai, the grand museums of Cairo and the epic sands of the Kalahari. But what I’ve been telling friends recently is this: If you’re anywhere in Britain this August then run, don’t walk, to the Kettlewell Scarecrow Festival in Yorkshire.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/06/travel/06Pursuits-england1/merlin_127829624_2c5820cc-ed7b-435a-ba63-acd050b6a857-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/06/travel/06Pursuits-england1/merlin_127829624_2c5820cc-ed7b-435a-ba63-acd050b6a857-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/06/travel/06Pursuits-england1/merlin_127829624_2c5820cc-ed7b-435a-ba63-acd050b6a857-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/06/travel/06Pursuits-england1/merlin_127829624_2c5820cc-ed7b-435a-ba63-acd050b6a857-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/06/travel/06Pursuits-england1/06Pursuits-england1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, '