e European Union is considering how to use funding cuts to promote the rule of law and an independent judiciary.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/01/world/europe/poland-hungary-european-union-money.html', 'snippet': 'In plans for its next multiyear budget, the European Union is considering how to use funding cuts to promote the rule of law and an independent judiciary.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRUSSELS — The European Union is largely about money — who gives it, who gets it and why. In the face of a challenge to European democratic values from Poland and Hungary, Brussels is naturally turning to money to get at least some leverage over the popular, populist governments there.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/02/world/europe/02eu-budget1-sub/merlin_136393785_fad66019-3c90-462b-a69f-c9ce7d8fc872-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/02/world/europe/02eu-budget1-sub/merlin_136393785_fad66019-3c90-462b-a69f-c9ce7d8fc872-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/02/world/europe/02eu-budget1-sub/merlin_136393785_fad66019-3c90-462b-a69f-c9ce7d8fc872-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/02/world/europe/02eu-budget1-sub/merlin_136393785_fad66019-3c90-462b-a69f-c9ce7d8fc872-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/02/world/europe/02eu-budget1