yt://article/b6af1f7a-6c1c-585f-96e4-826c5f4d64ef'}, {'abstract': 'Citing a dearth of qualified local candidates, schools are increasingly turning to foreign educators in the Philippines to fill core teaching jobs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/02/us/arizona-teachers-philippines.html', 'snippet': 'Citing a dearth of qualified local candidates, schools are increasingly turning to foreign educators in the Philippines to fill core teaching jobs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GLENDALE, Ariz. — The latest wave of foreign workers sweeping into American jobs brought Donato Soberano from the Philippines to Arizona two years ago. He had to pay thousands of dollars to a job broker and lived for a time in an apartment with five other Filipino workers. The lure is the pay — 10 times more than what he made doing the same work back home.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/03/us/03foreignteachers-1-print/merlin_137285904_58270920-010f-494b-ad8f-5df90faf660f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/03/us/03foreignteachers-1-print/merlin_137285904_58270920-010f-494b-ad8f-5df90faf660f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/03/us/03foreignteachers-1-print/merlin_137285904_58270920-010f-494b-ad8f-5df90faf660f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/03/us/03foreignteachers-1-print/merlin_137285904_58270920-010f-494b-ad8f-5df90faf660f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legac