99457736-fbbd-5c69-a6ca-a54da779d6a8', 'word_count': 1013, 'uri': 'nyt://article/99457736-fbbd-5c69-a6ca-a54da779d6a8'}, {'abstract': 'The founding of Demand Justice, which aims to persuade liberals to approach judicial fights with the same passion as conservatives, comes as President Trump is focused on remaking the federal courts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/03/us/politics/merrick-garland-judicial-trump.html', 'snippet': 'The founding of Demand Justice, which aims to persuade liberals to approach judicial fights with the same passion as conservatives, comes as President Trump is focused on remaking the federal courts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Democrats learned the hard way in 2016 that the right is much more animated by judicial fights after Republicans’ refusal to consider the Supreme Court nomination of Merrick B. Garland helped rally conservative voters behind Donald J. Trump so he could fill a vacancy held open for nearly a year.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/us/politics/04dc-hulse/merlin_105802741_6bdeb19f-6b16-4c8b-b604-cf217d1cd45a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/04/us/politics/04dc-hulse/merlin_105802741_6bdeb19f-6b16-4c8b-b604-cf217d1cd45a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/us/politics/04dc-hulse/merlin_105802741_6bdeb19f-6b16-4c8b-b604-cf217d1cd45a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/us/politics/04dc-hulse/merlin_105802741_6bdeb19f-6b16-4c8b-b604-cf217d1c