at talks this week will soothe trade tensions between China and the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/03/business/china-trade-negotiations.html', 'snippet': 'Missteps, confusion and a bureaucratic reshuffling on the Chinese side could lessen the already long odds that talks this week will soothe trade tensions between China and the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIJING — China is struggling to find people in Washington who can provide insight into the Trump administration’s aggressive moves on trade. One senior American trade insider tried to help — and wound up in Beijing with little to do but check out the pottery.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/world/04chinadisarray-1/merlin_137625282_963069f5-c8ee-41eb-bd42-fcf471cb949b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/04/world/04chinadisarray-1/merlin_137625282_963069f5-c8ee-41eb-bd42-fcf471cb949b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/world/04chinadisarray-1/merlin_137625282_963069f5-c8ee-41eb-bd42-fcf471cb949b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 686, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/world/04chinadisarray-1/merlin_137625282_963069f5-c8ee-41eb-bd42-fcf471cb949b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1372, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/world/04chinadisarray-1/04chinadisarray-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width':