6b7-731ee9bd486b'}, {'abstract': 'A young Joan Rivers was a struggling comic at the Duplex, a piece of Greenwich Village history near the Stonewall Monument. Now the tourists visit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/03/nyregion/at-the-duplex-nightlife-is-a-cabaret.html', 'snippet': 'A young Joan Rivers was a struggling comic at the Duplex, a piece of Greenwich Village history near the Stonewall Monument. Now the tourists visit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Just as the Duplex opened its doors at 4 in the afternoon, Harry Arkell, 34, a tourist from the United Kingdom, took a seat at the bar and ordered a glass of red wine. The former marketing executive had recently quit his job, ended a relationship and completed a weeklong meditation camp upstate. He would soon be headed for Panama, but not before making a pit stop in New York.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/06/nyregion/06JOINT1/06JOINT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 863, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/06/nyregion/06JOINT1/06JOINT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 863}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/06/nyregion/06JOINT1/06JOINT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 712, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/06/nyregion/06JOINT1/06JOINT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1424, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/06/nyregion/06JOINT1/06JOINT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'cr