'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jon Meacham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Meacham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/c12b38a4-b286-5cf3-bcf2-d51e98a0906e', 'word_count': 1244, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c12b38a4-b286-5cf3-bcf2-d51e98a0906e'}, {'abstract': 'An illness ended Tucker Halpern’s basketball career, but eight months in bed led him down a career path he didn’t expect: into music, as part of the dance pop duo Sofi Tukker.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/03/sports/sofi-tukker-music-basketball.html', 'snippet': 'An illness ended Tucker Halpern’s basketball career, but eight months in bed led him down a career path he didn’t expect: into music, as part of the dance pop duo Sofi Tukker.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is the travel: New York and Boston, Paris and Rio. There is the adrenaline of performing, the joy of bringing people to their feet. There is the money and the fame, each growing every time the iPhone commercials air or another venue sells out.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/sports/03drape-print1/merlin_137610261_76c78359-6b02-4da7-87ff-371aa7c4e5a5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/04/sports/03drape-print1/merlin_137610261_76c78359-6b02-4da7-87ff-371aa7c4e5a5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/sports/03drape-print1/merlin_137610261_76c78359-6b02-4da7-87ff-371aa7c4e5a5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/sports/03drape-print1/merlin_137610261_76c78359-6b02-4da7-87ff-371aa7c4e5a5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/sports/03drape-print1/03drape-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/04/sports/03drape-print1/03drape-web1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/sports/03drape-print1/03drape-web1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Career Turn: From N.C.A.A. Star to Grammy-Nominated D.J.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An N.C.A.A. Sweet Shooter Who Gave Up Fast Breaks for Break Beats', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sofi Tukker (Music Group)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grammy Awards', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-05-03T18:51:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joe Drape', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joe', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Drape', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/16413f2d-f990-5603-a297-088300466dec', 'word_count': 1218, 'uri': 'nyt://article/16413f2d-f990-5603-a297-088300466dec'}, {'abstract': 'The AT&T case could lead to an expanded view of the content and distribution market, perhaps changing what constitutes antitrust violation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/03/business/amazon-the-elephant-in-the-antitrust-room.html', 'snippet': 'The AT&T case could lead to an expanded view of the content and distribution market, perhaps changing what constitutes antitrust violation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When it comes to antitrust enforcement, one of the guiding principles is the effect on consumer prices. So the antitrust question of the moment is this: Will combining AT&T with Time Warner or Sprint with T-Mobile so diminish competition that prices go up?', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/business/04stewart-1/merlin_137472069_7093b25c-c10d-4d9b-ad82-82c3f1e12f1f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/04/business/04stewart-1/merlin_137472069_7093b25c-c10d-4d9b-ad82-82c3f1e12f1f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/business/04stewart-1/merlin_137472069_7093b25c-c10d-4d9b-ad82-82c3f1e12f1f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/business/04stewart-1/merlin_137472069_7093b25c-c10d-4d9b-ad82-82c3f1e12f1f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url