n the apartment?', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/06/realestate/06ASK/merlin_137597595_0ae6eeb7-2a37-43a7-9a3e-afc79ff3b9f9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 118, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/06/realestate/06ASK/merlin_137597595_0ae6eeb7-2a37-43a7-9a3e-afc79ff3b9f9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 118}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/06/realestate/06ASK/merlin_137597595_0ae6eeb7-2a37-43a7-9a3e-afc79ff3b9f9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 201, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/06/realestate/06ASK/merlin_137597595_0ae6eeb7-2a37-43a7-9a3e-afc79ff3b9f9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 1680, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/06/realestate/06ASK/merlin_137597595_0ae6eeb7-2a37-43a7-9a3e-afc79ff3b9f9-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/06/realestate/06ASK/merlin_137597595_0ae6eeb7-2a37-43a7-9a3e-afc79ff3b9f9-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/06/realestate/06ASK/merlin_137597595_0ae6eeb7-2a37-43a7-9a3e-afc79ff3b9f9-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When a Mentally Ill Sibling Disturbs the Neighbors', 'kicker': 'Ask Real Estate'