ph': '“The feeling at Oregon State right now is that our team is winning, so they’ve moved on. What does that say to the little girl in this case? What does it say to all survivors?”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: He Was Convicted of Molesting a 6-Year Old. Should He Have a Future in Baseball?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quote of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2018-05-08T03:39:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/a7c58d23-6229-5761-9bc5-8314424bc6c7', 'word_count': 69, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a7c58d23-6229-5761-9bc5-8314424bc6c7'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections appearing in print on Tuesday, May 8, 2018.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/07/pageoneplus/corrections-may-8-2018.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections appearing in print on Tuesday, May 8, 2018.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SPORTS', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: May 8, 2018', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2018-05-08T03:41:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/04dd333d-497c-57c0-a43a-0d5cfc8b8232', 'word_count': 235, 'uri': 'nyt://article/04dd333d-497c-57c0-a43a-0d5cfc8b8232'}, {'abstract': 'Eric Schneiderman stands accused of the very sorts of abuse he claimed to fight as state attorney general. Now it’s up to legislators to pick a true champion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/07/opinion/eric-schneiderman-metoo.html', 'snippet': 'Eric Schneiderman stands accused of the very sorts of abuse he claimed to fight as state attorney general. Now it’s up to legislators to pick a true champion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Until Monday evening New York’s Attorney General Eric Schneiderman was a public champion of the #MeToo movement. Now he appears to be the latest sickening example of the scale and insidiousness of the cruelty that movement is confronting. He resigned late Monday after The New Yorker magazine published an article in which four women accused him of abusing them physically and emotionally.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/08/opinion/09wed2web/merlin_131437506_cd67eab7-dcc2-4798-9fbf-d75fdc1fd065-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/08/opinion/09wed2web/merlin_131437506_cd67eab7-dcc2-4798-9fbf-d75fdc1fd065-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/08/opinion/09wed2web/merlin_131437506_cd67eab7-dcc2-4798-9fbf-d75fdc1fd065-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/08/opinion/09wed2web/merlin_131437506_cd67eab7-dcc2-4798-9fbf-d75fdc1fd065-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/08/opinion/09wed2web/09wed2web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/0