: 'An alliance of heretics is making an end run around the mainstream conversation. Should we be listening?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/08/opinion/intellectual-dark-web.html', 'snippet': 'An alliance of heretics is making an end run around the mainstream conversation. Should we be listening?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here are some things that you will hear when you sit down to dinner with the vanguard of the Intellectual Dark Web: There are fundamental biological differences between men and women. Free speech is under siege. Identity politics is a toxic ideology that is tearing American society apart. And we’re in a dangerous place if these ideas are considered “dark.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/opinion/00weiss1/merlin_136770123_708d27e8-aa19-45c2-8131-addb43412c0f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 871, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/04/opinion/00weiss1/merlin_136770123_708d27e8-aa19-45c2-8131-addb43412c0f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 871}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/opinion/00weiss1/merlin_136770123_708d27e8-aa19-45c2-8131-addb43412c0f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 706, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/opinion/00weiss1/merlin_136770123_708d27e8-aa19-45c2-8131-addb43412c0f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1411, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/04/opinion/00weiss1/00weiss1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStan