ds” deviated only slightly from her favorite color when decorating her Los Angeles home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/08/style/leanne-ford-white-color.html', 'snippet': 'The designer and star of HGTV’s “Restored by the Fords” deviated only slightly from her favorite color when decorating her Los Angeles home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On her HGTV show, “Restored by the Fords,” Leanne Ford paints everything white, so it’s no surprise that her tiny, early 20th-century four-room cabin in the Echo Park section of Los Angeles would be white. Ms. Ford is a host of the show, along with her brother, Steve Ford, a carpenter with a dry sense of humor and a penchant for wearing a backward baseball cap. (In one episode, in the middle of construction she wrapped a drop cloth around him and trimmed his long hair. “I think I’d be better off with a construction guy cutting my hair,” he said playfully.)', 'print_section': 'F', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/10/style/10WHITEHOUSE4/10WHITEHOUSE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 868, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/10/style/10WHITEHOUSE4/10WHITEHOUSE4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 868}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/10/style/10WHITEHOUSE4/10WHITEHOUSE4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 708, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/10/style/10WHITEHOUSE4/10WHITEHOUSE4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1416, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/10/style