, 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8b0594ef-5beb-56b8-953b-fa9b55ac0bf4', 'word_count': 927, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8b0594ef-5beb-56b8-953b-fa9b55ac0bf4'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Olmi was more famous at home in Italy than abroad, but he won international acclaim for films like “The Tree of Wooden Clogs” and “Il Posto.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/08/obituaries/ermanno-olmi-whose-films-captured-humble-lives-dies-at-86.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Olmi was more famous at home in Italy than abroad, but he won international acclaim for films like “The Tree of Wooden Clogs” and “Il Posto.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ermanno Olmi, a largely self-taught Italian director who wove family folk tales and unadorned accounts of farm life, class and Roman Catholicism into neorealist films that often starred amateur actors, died on Friday in Asiago, Italy. He was 86.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/10/obituaries/09olmi1/09olmi1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 818, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/10/obituaries/09olmi1/09olmi1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 818}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/10/obituaries/09olmi1/09olmi1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 751, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/10/obituaries/09olmi1/09olmi1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2008, 'width': 1472, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/0