: the need to overlook fatal flaws in a cute summer house.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/10/nyregion/summer-house-madness.html', 'snippet': 'It’s time to shine a light on Seasonal Realty Disorder: the need to overlook fatal flaws in a cute summer house.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is a lot of shame about mental illness, and in an attempt to change this and perhaps help others, I’m going to come right out and say it: The disturbing rumors you’ve been hearing about me are true. Two weeks ago, I almost did buy a country house that was all wrong for me.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/13/nyregion/13MISINFORMED/merlin_137906289_9b7c914d-515e-4347-ac43-0601a78c271a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 484, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/13/nyregion/13MISINFORMED/merlin_137906289_9b7c914d-515e-4347-ac43-0601a78c271a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 484}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/13/nyregion/13MISINFORMED/merlin_137906289_9b7c914d-515e-4347-ac43-0601a78c271a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 826, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/13/nyregion/13MISINFORMED/merlin_137906289_9b7c914d-515e-4347-ac43-0601a78c271a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1651, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/13/nyregion/13MISINFORMED/13MISINFORMED-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2