 take place around the world. Here’s how to add one to your next vacation itinerary.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/10/travel/art-fairs-international-tips.html', 'snippet': 'Art fairs aren’t just for fancy dealers and art buyers — regular art lovers can enjoy them too, and they take place around the world. Here’s how to add one to your next vacation itinerary.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Whether it’s ZONAMACO, in Mexico City, The Armory Show, in New York, or Art Basel, held in Basel, Switzerland, Miami Beach and Hong Kong, art fairs are more accessible and popular than ever. Attending a fair should be a part of any travel itinerary, according to Natasha Schlesinger, art historian and founder of ArtMuse, a company that offers private tours of art fairs in New York City and Europe.  ', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/13/travel/13TIPS/merlin_137785836_a24e8592-4d8d-4c71-98c2-5d76f5a36fee-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/13/travel/13TIPS/merlin_137785836_a24e8592-4d8d-4c71-98c2-5d76f5a36fee-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/13/travel/13TIPS/merlin_137785836_a24e8592-4d8d-4c71-98c2-5d76f5a36fee-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/13/travel/13TIPS/merlin_137785836_a24e8592-4d8d-4c71-98c2-5d76f5a36fee-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url'