06350d960e'}, {'abstract': 'Jacob Tremblay, Keegan-Michael Key and Boyd Holbrook star in fourth entry in the franchise. Shane Black directs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/10/movies/the-predator-trailer-shane-black.html', 'snippet': 'Jacob Tremblay, Keegan-Michael Key and Boyd Holbrook star in fourth entry in the franchise. Shane Black directs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Back in 1987, the same year he made his screenwriting breakthrough with “Lethal Weapon,” Shane Black also acted in the sci-fi hit “Predator.” More than 30 years later, he returns to the monster-movie franchise as the director and a writer of “The Predator,” which now has its first trailer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘The Predator’ Trailer: Genetically Enhanced Monsters', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Black, Shane', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'The Predator (Movie)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Key, Keegan-Michael', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tremblay, Jacob (2006- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Holbrook, Boyd (1981- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-05-10T14:48:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Fretts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fretts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/072c1720-1d57-52e0-bbce-f03f96b0c69a', 'word_count': 173, 'uri': 'nyt://article/072c1720-1d57-52e0-bbce-f03f96b0c69a'}, {'abstract': 'An 18-year prison term for the founder of Anbang Insurance Group is part of Beijing’s effort to tame risky borrowing without hurting the broader economy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/10/business/china-anbang-wu-xiaohui-debt.html', 'snippet': 'An 18-year prison term for the founder of Anbang Insurance Group is part of Beijing’s effort to tame risky borrowing without hurting the broader economy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — A Shanghai court imprisoned a tycoon who used a mountain of debt to buy the Waldorf Astoria hotel. Small Chinese companies are increasingly saying they cannot repay their bills, as money gets more expensive or harder to find. For other private businesses, the cost to borrow has shot up.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/business/11chinarisk/merlin_136108689_c4f16c27-2680-47b7-9059-01f32fd8ec98-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/11/business/11chinarisk/merlin_136108689_c4f16c27-2680-47b7-9059-01f32fd8ec98-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/business/11chinarisk/merlin_136108689_c4f16c27-2680-47b7-9059-01f32fd8ec98-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/business/11chinarisk/merlin_136108689_c4f16c27-2680-47b7-9059-01f32fd8ec98-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/business/11chinarisk/merlin_136108689_c4f16c27-2680-47b7-9059-01f32fd8ec98-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height'