hearing the rhythmic sounds through the wall of her apartment in Harlem.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a pop singer in Japan, TiA landed a recording contract when she was 16. She released a single and an album when she was 17, and another single when she was 18. But she started burning out, and by the time she was 27, she quit, tired of rehearsing, traveling and performing.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/nyregion/11japangospel1/merlin_136391949_d08dd231-a4f3-44f9-8faf-81596304481b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/11/nyregion/11japangospel1/merlin_136391949_d08dd231-a4f3-44f9-8faf-81596304481b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/nyregion/11japangospel1/merlin_136391949_d08dd231-a4f3-44f9-8faf-81596304481b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/nyregion/11japangospel1/merlin_136391949_d08dd231-a4f3-44f9-8faf-81596304481b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/nyregion/11japangospel1/00japangospel1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/11/nyregion/11japangospel1/00japangospel1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/nyregion/11japangospel1/00japangospel1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'From Japan to Harlem, a Gospel Singer Is Born', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'From Japan to Harlem, Singing Gospel From the Soul', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gospel Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Hope Community Church (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Takayama, Tomoka (TiA)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Newark Symphony Hall', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pop and Rock Music', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Newark (NJ)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-05-10T14:57:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Barron', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barron', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/44a816bf-ebed-5ff9-aa24-85293499da86', 'word_count': 1292, 'uri': 'nyt://article/44a816bf-ebed-5ff9-aa24-85293499da86'}, {'abstract': 'The largest bat in Europe, a vulnerable species, found shelter in a city park’s trees. Then they started to turn up dead.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/10/science/parakeets-bats-invasive-species.html', 'snippet': 'The largest bat in Europe, a vulnerable species, found shelter in a city park’s trees. Then they started to turn up dead.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The greater noctule is the largest bat in Europe. It is listed as “vulnerable” on the threatened species list, but for many years these winged mammals found shelter in the hollows o