ave Everton for M.L.S.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'DC United (Soccer Team)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Major League Soccer', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rooney, Wayne', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-05-10T15:06:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Das', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Das', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/808476f2-64a4-5a2a-a2d7-db0cd924f524', 'word_count': 387, 'uri': 'nyt://article/808476f2-64a4-5a2a-a2d7-db0cd924f524'}, {'abstract': 'Alleviating suffering involves providing comfort, solace and coziness, even if that takes the shape of a fluffy golden teddy bear.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/10/well/live/when-doctors-give-their-patients-gifts.html', 'snippet': 'Alleviating suffering involves providing comfort, solace and coziness, even if that takes the shape of a fluffy golden teddy bear.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I was a medical student, I often found myself in the hospital gift shop. The gift shop was an oasis for me, not only because of the expansive candy selection that palliated my sugar cravings, but also because I could see gift-givers in cross-section. Loved ones came in and out, buying balloons for newborns and flowers for their parents or children. One would buy a newspaper for her spouse to read; another doting husband would buy a scarf for his wife to hide the scar from her recent surgery. Through their gifts, they were not only showing their love, but also their hope and yearning for health, for success, for life.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/well/doctors-gift/doctors-gift-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/24/well/doctors-gift/doctors-gift-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/well/doctors-gift/doctors-gift-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/well/doctors-gift/doctors-gift-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/well/doctors-gift/doctors-gift-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/24/well/doctors-gift/doctors-gift-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/24/well/doctors-gift/doctors-gift-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When Doctors Give Their Patients Gifts', 'kicker': 'Doctors', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gifts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hospitals', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-05-10T15:06:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'We