-b314-5a56-a6c9-3ede9c38b698'}, {'abstract': 'With New York City Ballet performing Robbins rarities this season, we have the chance to reassess this complex, mold-breaking artist.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/10/arts/dance/jerome-robbins-the-experimentalist-new-york-city-ballet.html', 'snippet': 'With New York City Ballet performing Robbins rarities this season, we have the chance to reassess this complex, mold-breaking artist.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s easy to forget that the choreographer Jerome Robbins was often an experimentalist. Robbins is rightly celebrated as the creator of memorable and popular ballets, as a master of Broadway musicals and as a show doctor of legendary skill. But not all Robbins works were successes; he needed to take risks.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/arts/11ROBBINS-RARITIES1/merlin_137908302_735178de-ba8c-490a-b209-3b5a9c285b9d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/11/arts/11ROBBINS-RARITIES1/merlin_137908302_735178de-ba8c-490a-b209-3b5a9c285b9d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/arts/11ROBBINS-RARITIES1/merlin_137908302_735178de-ba8c-490a-b209-3b5a9c285b9d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/arts/11ROBBINS-RARITIES1/merlin_137908302_735178de-ba8c-490a-b209-3b5a9c285b9d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1360, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'ty