n opposite directions.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/10/arts/dance/giselle-lucia-and-romantic-madness.html', 'snippet': 'In Romantic drama it’s mainly women who go mad — usually because of love. But opera and ballet take their mad heroines in opposite directions.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When the mind loses its moorings, it unsettles others. Even while the deranged person is cast adrift from aspects of reality, he or she can see things others don’t; and is often obsessed by those alternative realities. Madness is immediately dramatic; and its drama can take many forms.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/13/arts/13MADSCENEb/merlin_137597865_0820a4d4-77e9-462d-a27e-7480928f08cc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/13/arts/13MADSCENEb/merlin_137597865_0820a4d4-77e9-462d-a27e-7480928f08cc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/13/arts/13MADSCENEb/merlin_137597865_0820a4d4-77e9-462d-a27e-7480928f08cc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/13/arts/13MADSCENEb/merlin_137597865_0820a4d4-77e9-462d-a27e-7480928f08cc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1360, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/13/arts/13MADSCENEb/13MADSCENEb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/13/arts/13