1556fa5347a'}, {'abstract': 'A report and a Pentagon video about the deadly attack show soldiers scrambling to administer aid and find a way to stay alive in a one-sided battle.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/10/us/politics/niger-report-video.html', 'snippet': 'A report and a Pentagon video about the deadly attack show soldiers scrambling to administer aid and find a way to stay alive in a one-sided battle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Four American commandos take off on foot, under heavy gunfire, to look for missing teammates in the borderland of Niger. Another is shot in the elbow behind the wheel of a vehicle yet continues to drive. That driver, after his team leader is shot and thrown from his truck, turns the vehicle around and goes back to pick him up as militants loyal to the Islamic State close in.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/us/11dc-ambush-print/merlin_137923716_c4efee2b-1e70-4daf-a680-7261bf98db1e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 240, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/11/us/11dc-ambush-print/merlin_137923716_c4efee2b-1e70-4daf-a680-7261bf98db1e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 240}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/us/11dc-ambush-print/merlin_137923716_c4efee2b-1e70-4daf-a680-7261bf98db1e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 409, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/us/11dc-ambush-print/merlin_137923716_c4efee2b-1e70-4daf-a680-7261bf98db1e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 818, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thum