soaring prescription costs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump will lay out on Friday a broad strategy to reduce prescription drug prices, but in a break from one of his most popular campaign promises, he will not call for Medicare to negotiate lower prices with drug manufacturers, senior administration officials said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/autossell/11DC-HEALTH-01/merlin_137902791_2680bd11-053c-4244-bf17-29bdde1a069a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 379, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/11/autossell/11DC-HEALTH-01/merlin_137902791_2680bd11-053c-4244-bf17-29bdde1a069a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 379}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/autossell/11DC-HEALTH-01/merlin_137902791_2680bd11-053c-4244-bf17-29bdde1a069a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/autossell/11DC-HEALTH-01/merlin_137902791_2680bd11-053c-4244-bf17-29bdde1a069a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1293, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/11/autossell/11DC-HEALTH-01/11DC-HEALTH-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/11/autossell/11DC-HEALTH-01/11DC-HEALTH-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/