. Here’s how to minimize the damage. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'Send your workplace conundrums to workologist@nytimes.com, including your name and contact information (even if you want it withheld). The Workologist is a guy with well-intentioned opinions, not a professional career adviser. Letters may be edited.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/13/business/13Workologist/merlin_137962431_2bcef729-7ddf-4f40-adc4-31592cdcc6e0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 482, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/13/business/13Workologist/merlin_137962431_2bcef729-7ddf-4f40-adc4-31592cdcc6e0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 482}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/13/business/13Workologist/merlin_137962431_2bcef729-7ddf-4f40-adc4-31592cdcc6e0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 822, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/13/business/13Workologist/merlin_137962431_2bcef729-7ddf-4f40-adc4-31592cdcc6e0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1645, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/13/business/13Workologist/merlin_137962431_2bcef729-7ddf-4f40-adc4-31592cdcc6e0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/13/business/13Workologist/merlin_137962431_2bcef729-7ddf-4f40-adc4-31592cdcc6e0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '