atement in Dublin — and not just of the fashion kind. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/14/fashion/repeal-the-8th-ireland-abortion.html', 'snippet': 'Two weeks before a historic referendum, the style set make a statement in Dublin — and not just of the fashion kind. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dublin is not a city known for its fashion extravaganzas. But last Thursday, inside the vaulted atrium of the upmarket Powerscourt Centre shopping arcade, models took to the catwalk clad in one-off couture creations by a dozen of Ireland’s best known designers. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/14/fashion/14IRELAND-protest/merlin_138012708_3a542bab-25d2-4896-afaf-05173e0a6328-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/14/fashion/14IRELAND-protest/merlin_138012708_3a542bab-25d2-4896-afaf-05173e0a6328-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/14/fashion/14IRELAND-protest/merlin_138012708_3a542bab-25d2-4896-afaf-05173e0a6328-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/14/fashion/14IRELAND-protest/merlin_138012708_3a542bab-25d2-4896-afaf-05173e0a6328-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/14/fashion/14IRELAND-protest/14IRELAND-protest-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/14/fashion/14IRELAND-prot