ut $200 to make; he sold them for about $700 a piece.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/01/fashion/01FERG/merlin_137944902_d50e2d98-2b01-489c-afca-4313ff3268e7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 840, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/06/01/fashion/01FERG/merlin_137944902_d50e2d98-2b01-489c-afca-4313ff3268e7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 840}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/01/fashion/01FERG/merlin_137944902_d50e2d98-2b01-489c-afca-4313ff3268e7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 732, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/01/fashion/01FERG/merlin_137944902_d50e2d98-2b01-489c-afca-4313ff3268e7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1463, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/01/fashion/01FERG/01FERG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/06/01/fashion/01FERG/01FERG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/01/fashion/01FERG/01FERG-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'ASAP Ferg Feels ‘Like a Walking MoMA Installation’ ', 'kicker': 'Eight Gold Rings + Four Gold Chains', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Team: Rap Artist And Tiffany', 'name': None, 'se