82, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4f7def8c-517a-582d-829a-cb77156b4287'}, {'abstract': 'One fellow composer said Mr. Branca, who often wrote for massed amplified guitars, was among the few “who put a clearly defined stamp on their music.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/15/obituaries/glenn-branca-composer-who-blended-genres-loudly-dies-at-69.html', 'snippet': 'One fellow composer said Mr. Branca, who often wrote for massed amplified guitars, was among the few “who put a clearly defined stamp on their music.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Glenn Branca, a composer who began his musical life playing with influential Downtown rock bands in New York in the 1970s, but whose omnivorous musical curiosity soon led him to create a hybrid style — blending classical, rock and avant-garde elements — that laid the foundation for much of today’s genre-crossing new music, died on Sunday in Manhattan. He was 69.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/17/obituaries/17BRANCA1-print/merlin_138186210_2d8c91b4-8cf9-4577-b738-b9f7055eab6b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/17/obituaries/17BRANCA1-print/merlin_138186210_2d8c91b4-8cf9-4577-b738-b9f7055eab6b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 402}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/17/obituaries/17BRANCA1-print/merlin_138186210_2d8c91b4-8cf9-4577-b738-b9f7055eab6b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/17/obituaries/17BRANCA1-print/merlin_138186210_2d8c91b4-8cf9-4577-b738-b9f7055eab6b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1371, 'width': 2048, 's