But all agreed on the potential for the plan to irrevocably alter the course of their businesses.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/15/us/politics/trump-china-tariffs-hearings.html', 'snippet': 'Some of those testifying about the proposal commended the tariffs, and others criticized them. But all agreed on the potential for the plan to irrevocably alter the course of their businesses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Mary Buchzeiger describes herself as a proud Republican who was drawn to President Trump’s business-friendly philosophy. But the president’s plan to impose sweeping tariffs on $50 billion of products from China now threatens to cripple an automotive supply business in Michigan that her father began and that she has spent years building.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/16/business/16dc-chinatariff-sub/merlin_138201912_00e11839-d9d9-473e-b832-a8d9812d48f5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/16/business/16dc-chinatariff-sub/merlin_138201912_00e11839-d9d9-473e-b832-a8d9812d48f5-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 429}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/16/business/16dc-chinatariff-sub/merlin_138201912_00e11839-d9d9-473e-b832-a8d9812d48f5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/16/business/16dc-chinatariff-sub/merlin_138201912_00e11839-d9d9-473e-b832-a8d9812d48f5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1463, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'cre