.nytimes.com/2018/05/15/business/dealbook/fraud-sophisticated-investors.html', 'snippet': 'Two recent cases show that misstatements are not necessarily enough to prove securities fraud when sophisticated investors are involved.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Proving a case of fraud seems easy: find a lie and show someone lost money because of it, or at least paid more than they should have. But in the trading of mortgage securities, a lie might not mean fraud.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/12/business/dealbook/12db-henning1/merlin_137642490_d81a0913-eaf2-404f-905b-f6da80504b5b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 418, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/12/business/dealbook/12db-henning1/merlin_137642490_d81a0913-eaf2-404f-905b-f6da80504b5b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 418}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/12/business/dealbook/12db-henning1/merlin_137642490_d81a0913-eaf2-404f-905b-f6da80504b5b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 713, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/12/business/dealbook/12db-henning1/merlin_137642490_d81a0913-eaf2-404f-905b-f6da80504b5b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1425, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/12/business/dealbook/12db-henning1/12db-henning1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/12/business/dealbook/12db-henning1/12db-henning1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight':