tion of bright white blooms lasts only for a short time, and that time is now.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/16/nyregion/blaze-of-glory.html', 'snippet': 'The dogwood tree’s eruption of bright white blooms lasts only for a short time, and that time is now.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are few trees as admired as the flowering dogwood. And it is obvious why, especially in spring, when the tree produces hundreds of stark, white, three-inch blossoms. Contrasting sharply against the intense green backdrop of the early season woodlands, they are as alluring as lace, and form a finely etched underside to the rapidly developing woodland canopy in our local woods.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/nyregion/20nature/20nature-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/20/nyregion/20nature/20nature-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/nyregion/20nature/20nature-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/nyregion/20nature/20nature-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/nyregion/20nature/20nature-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/20/nyregion/20nature/20nature-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {