estigation into Russian election meddling and possible ties to Trump associates was originally called Crossfire Hurricane. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/16/us/politics/fbi-code-names-investigations-crossfire-hurricane.html', 'snippet': 'The F.B.I. investigation into Russian election meddling and possible ties to Trump associates was originally called Crossfire Hurricane. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'The investigation into President Trump’s campaign and its ties to Russia is best known today by the man who runs it,  Robert S. Mueller III, the special counsel. But the F.B.I. conducted the investigation for nearly a year before Mr. Mueller was appointed. To the agents, it was known by its internal code name: Crossfire Hurricane. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/17/us/politics/17dc-codename/merlin_137979255_4d345951-3bba-42c0-98de-a1b3908472df-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/17/us/politics/17dc-codename/merlin_137979255_4d345951-3bba-42c0-98de-a1b3908472df-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/17/us/politics/17dc-codename/merlin_137979255_4d345951-3bba-42c0-98de-a1b3908472df-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/17/us/politics/17dc-codename/merlin_137979255_4d345951-3bba-42c0-98de-a1b3908472df-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/17/us/politics/17dc-codename/17