3ca-69ea84456760'}, {'abstract': 'The Yankees have played only five and a half innings over the last three days, but they face a rigorous schedule in the coming weeks because of an unusually wet and wintry start to the season.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/16/sports/new-york-yankees-washington-nationals.html', 'snippet': 'The Yankees have played only five and a half innings over the last three days, but they face a rigorous schedule in the coming weeks because of an unusually wet and wintry start to the season.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Yankees packed their belongings and headed to the airport on Wednesday for a flight to Kansas City, Mo., having played only five and a half innings over the last three days. But their visit here might not have been completely fruitless.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/17/sports/17yankeesweb1/17yankeesweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 419, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/17/sports/17yankeesweb1/17yankeesweb1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 419}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/17/sports/17yankeesweb1/17yankeesweb1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 716, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/17/sports/17yankeesweb1/17yankeesweb1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1432, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/17/sports/17yankeesweb1/17yankeesweb1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail',