at party has long supported her.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/16/nyregion/attorney-general-james-cuomo-ny.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. James said she was pursuing the Democratic ballot line, not the Working Families Party’s line, even though that party has long supported her.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Letitia James, the New York City public advocate, declared her candidacy for the Democratic nomination for attorney general on Wednesday, ending a week filled with rumors and political machinations about whether she would be appointed to the office or run for it, and with which party’s backing.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/17/nyregion/17tishjames/17tishjames-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/17/nyregion/17tishjames/17tishjames-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/17/nyregion/17tishjames/17tishjames-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/17/nyregion/17tishjames/17tishjames-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/17/nyregion/17tishjames/17tishjames-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/17/nyregion/17tishjames/17tishjames-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'c