en in rooms as large as this one. With a practiced gesture, Michael herded Sarah and a bunch of dresses into the room and pulled the curtain shut behind him. I’m on the exile side before I can open my mouth to protest.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/fashion/20MOTHEROFTHEBRIDE-2/merlin_137377188_1d51293a-dafd-4810-b13c-96c28bcfb26d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/20/fashion/20MOTHEROFTHEBRIDE-2/merlin_137377188_1d51293a-dafd-4810-b13c-96c28bcfb26d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 429}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/fashion/20MOTHEROFTHEBRIDE-2/merlin_137377188_1d51293a-dafd-4810-b13c-96c28bcfb26d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/fashion/20MOTHEROFTHEBRIDE-2/merlin_137377188_1d51293a-dafd-4810-b13c-96c28bcfb26d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1463, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/fashion/20MOTHEROFTHEBRIDE-2/merlin_137377188_1d51293a-dafd-4810-b13c-96c28bcfb26d-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/20/fashion/20MOTHEROFTHEBRIDE-2/merlin_137377188_1d51293a-dafd-4810-b13c-96c28bcfb26d-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/fashion/20M