ring the Muslim holy month of Ramadan, hoping to revive peace talks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/17/world/asia/india-kashmir-cease-fire-ramadan.html', 'snippet': 'For the first time in 15 years, the Indian government has called a halt to military operations during the Muslim holy month of Ramadan, hoping to revive peace talks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SRINAGAR, Kashmir — The Indian government said it would halt operations against separatist militants in Jammu and Kashmir State during the Muslim holy month of Ramadan, which began on Thursday. It was the first time in 18 years that the Indian government declared a cease-fire for Ramadan in the territory.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/18/world/18kashmir-print/merlin_137849181_a9cdf9d6-1f45-4778-a11d-9e194553e1d3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/18/world/18kashmir-print/merlin_137849181_a9cdf9d6-1f45-4778-a11d-9e194553e1d3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/18/world/18kashmir-print/merlin_137849181_a9cdf9d6-1f45-4778-a11d-9e194553e1d3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/18/world/18kashmir-print/merlin_137849181_a9cdf9d6-1f45-4778-a11d-9e194553e1d3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/18/world/18kashmir-print/merlin_137849181_a9cdf9d6-1f45-4778-a11d-9e194553e1d3