ing is now “behind” us.  ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What Time Was the Royal Wedding in My Time Zone?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Time', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harry, Prince of Wales', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Markle, Meghan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-05-17T14:26:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/394526fb-4b41-596f-beb5-6d28d2f8379c', 'word_count': 301, 'uri': 'nyt://article/394526fb-4b41-596f-beb5-6d28d2f8379c'}, {'abstract': 'The plaintiffs are looking to force statewide desegregation in one of the most segregated states in the country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/17/nyregion/new-jersey-school-segregation-suit.html', 'snippet': 'The plaintiffs are looking to force statewide desegregation in one of the most segregated states in the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Christian Estevez, the son of Dominican immigrants, grew up in the 1970s in Plainfield, N.J., at a time of widespread white flight. Most of the children in his crowded elementary school classes were like him: poor, minority and struggling.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/17/nyregion/17desegregate/merlin_138256260_2a1c822d-386f-48a9-a781-25ead55e1256-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/17/nyregion/17desegr