icle/10c34610-5a88-5eff-9544-72b516d23dca'}, {'abstract': 'Arthur Jafa’s triumphal debut consisted of a seven-minute video. Two years later, he’s back with artworks in three media on as many floors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/17/arts/design/arthur-jafa-review-gavin-browns-enterprise.html', 'snippet': 'Arthur Jafa’s triumphal debut consisted of a seven-minute video. Two years later, he’s back with artworks in three media on as many floors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Arthur Jafa is back, nearly two years after his indelible New York solo debut at Gavin Brown’s enterprise. That show helped introduce the artist, 57, and previously best known as a filmmaker and cinematographer, to the wider art world, and it consisted of one revelatory video made mostly of existing footage. A head-spinning seven-minute compilation of joy, pain and harsh fact, “Love Is the Message, the Message Is Death” encompassed the complexities of life for black Americans: the history, the horrors, the cultural achievements, the enduring sense of community. This transformative masterpiece was in many ways an uplifting slap in the face of white America.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/18/arts/18jafa1/merlin_138238884_5f0e6f9a-85af-44a1-a882-f92f81052df9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 821, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/18/arts/18jafa1/merlin_138238884_5f0e6f9a-85af-44a1-a882-f92f81052df9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 821}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/18/arts/18jafa1/merlin_138238884_5f0e6f9a-85af-44a1-a882-f92f81052df9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 749, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/18/arts/18jafa1/merlin_138238884_5f0e6f9a-85af-44a1-a882-f92f81052df9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1498, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/18/arts/18jafa1/18jafa1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/18/arts/18jafa1/18jafa1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/18/arts/18jafa1/18jafa1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Arthur Jafa’s Profound Meditations on Black America', 'kicker': 'Art Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Artist Returns, Showing More of Himself', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jafa, Arthur (1960- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Green, Al', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Gavin Brown's Enterprise", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Race and Ethnicity', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-05-17T17:54:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Roberta Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Roberta', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/d17f203a-3c5a-5022-aeb4-bea4e309afa9', 'word_count': 874, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d17f203a-3c5a-5022-aeb4-bea4e309afa9'}, {'abstract': 'The men are fixtures on cable news — Mr. Avenatti, the lawyer for a pornographic actress suing the president, as Mr. Trump’s antagonist, and Mr. Scaramucci as the president’s supporter.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/17/business/media/michael-avenatti-anthony-scaramucci-television-show.html', 'snippet': 'The men are fixtures on cable news — Mr. Avenatti, the lawyer for a pornographic actress suing the president, as Mr. Trump’s antagonist, and Mr. Scaramucci as the president’s supporter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A television show featuring Michael Avenatti, the lawyer who is suing President Trump on behalf of a pornographic film actress, and the former White House communications director Anthony Scaramucci was pitched to two cable networks in recent weeks, people briefed on the matter said on Thursday.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/18/us/politics/18dc-avenatti/merlin_136768173_747acbf6-2c7c-4076-85fe-9eb05128019c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 440, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/18/us/politics/18dc-avenatti/merlin_136768173_747acbf6-2c7c-4076-85fe-9eb05128019c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 440}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/18/us/politics/18dc-avenatti/merlin_136768173_747acbf6-2c7c-4076-85fe-9eb05128019c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 751, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'typ