k with a special about her family happiness, is relieved she’s no longer “tied to such a negative person,” a.k.a. Louis C.K.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/18/arts/television/tig-notaro-louis-ck-metoo.html', 'snippet': 'The comic, who’s back with a special about her family happiness, is relieved she’s no longer “tied to such a negative person,” a.k.a. Louis C.K.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The name of Tig Notaro’s new Netflix comedy special, “Happy to Be Here,” could be taken as sarcasm given her ups and downs over the last year. Ms. Notaro made headlines last fall for swinging hard at her most famous champion, Louis C.K., in an episode of her lauded Amazon series, “One Mississippi.” It featured a male boss masturbating in front of a female underling, the very act that Louis C.K., an executive producer of the show, would end up being accused of and admitting to.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/19/arts/19tig-notaro1/merlin_138312441_dfc861be-16dd-426e-8e3a-e3780d3f2ae2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 736, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/19/arts/19tig-notaro1/merlin_138312441_dfc861be-16dd-426e-8e3a-e3780d3f2ae2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 736}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/19/arts/19tig-notaro1/merlin_138312441_dfc861be-16dd-426e-8e3a-e3780d3f2ae2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 836, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/19/arts/19tig-notaro1/merlin_138312441_dfc861be-16dd-426e-8e3a-e3780d3f2ae2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1671, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legac