times.com/2018/05/19/opinion/sunday/addiction-cancer-treatment.html', 'snippet': 'People with substance-use disorders shouldn’t have to work so hard to get care.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two years ago, I spent a week in Houston helping my stepbrother while he underwent treatment for Stage 4 lymphoma at the University of Texas MD Anderson Cancer Center. I sat with him while a nurse cleaned his chemo port and made records of her work, to keep his medical team updated. I accompanied him for the blood tests that determined his readiness for the next treatment. I stayed by his bed as his stem cells were harvested for a transplant, one of the cutting-edge, evidence-based therapies that ultimately saved his life.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/sunday/20hilgers/merlin_138344703_b93e9581-28a4-4ac0-9071-202699a128da-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 464, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/sunday/20hilgers/merlin_138344703_b93e9581-28a4-4ac0-9071-202699a128da-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 464}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/sunday/20hilgers/merlin_138344703_b93e9581-28a4-4ac0-9071-202699a128da-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 793, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/sunday/20hilgers/merlin_138344703_b93e9581-28a4-4ac0-9071-202699a128da-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1585, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/sunday/20hilgers/20hilgers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/sunday/20hilgers/20hilgers-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/sunday/20hilgers/20hilgers-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Treat Addiction Like Cancer', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Treat Addiction Like Cancer', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Addiction (Psychology)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Alcohol Abuse', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-05-19T18:30:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laura Hilgers', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laura', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hilgers', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/c153099b-3946-5406-8d48-c5a58d8c190c', 'word_count': 1163, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c153099b-3946-5406-8d48-c5a58d8c190c'}, {'abstract': 'How political corruption seeped into this last great symbol of national pride.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/19/opinion/sunday/miss-venezuela-corruption.html', 'snippet': 'How political corruption seeped into this last great symbol of national pride.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I was growing up, in the height of the oil boom, few events emptied the streets of Caracas like the Miss Venezuela pageant. The show was broadcast live from luxury hotels most Venezuelans could only dream of entering for a whiskycito. The women stood in troop formation, sheathed in evening gowns or folkloric costumes or bathing suits. They were introduced by name, age, body measurements and eye color. Fans sang the show’s anthem by heart — “On such a lovely night as this, any one of us could triumph.”', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/sunday/20abbady1/20abbady1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 387, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/sunday/20abbady1/20abbady1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 387}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/sunday/20abbady1/20abbady1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/sunday/20abbady1/20abbady1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1322, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/sunday/20abbady1/20abbady1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/sunday/20abbady1/20abbady1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/sunday/20abbady1/20abbady1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 