e404ce4d92ce'}, {'abstract': 'We asked readers in Venezuela to describe living with low wages, runaway inflation and shortages as a presidential election approached. Here is what they said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/20/opinion/venezuela-election-maduro.html', 'snippet': 'We asked readers in Venezuela to describe living with low wages, runaway inflation and shortages as a presidential election approached. Here is what they said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On Sunday, a presidential election is taking place in Venezuela against the background of a deepening economic crisis. The oil-rich country is suffering water and power shortages, and its people are struggling to pay for food and medicines. Many people have fled to neighboring countries.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/20venezuela-callout-1/20venezuela-callout-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/20venezuela-callout-1/20venezuela-callout-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/20venezuela-callout-1/20venezuela-callout-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/20venezuela-callout-1/20venezuela-callout-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/20/opinion/20venezuela-callout-1/20venezuela-callout-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'c