the show and debate it over lunch. Vanessa Friedman, The Times’s chief fashion critic, leads its global coverage. Ross Douthat is an Op-Ed columnist, a Roman Catholic, as well as the author of a new book, “To Change the Church: Pope Francis and the Future of Catholicism.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/21/arts/21museum1/merlin_138285297_99a03063-e69c-4fd0-8889-72ac8d892efd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/21/arts/21museum1/merlin_138285297_99a03063-e69c-4fd0-8889-72ac8d892efd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/21/arts/21museum1/merlin_138285297_99a03063-e69c-4fd0-8889-72ac8d892efd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/21/arts/21museum1/merlin_138285297_99a03063-e69c-4fd0-8889-72ac8d892efd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/21/arts/21museum1/21museum1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/21/arts/21museum1/21museum1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/21/arts/21museum1/21museum1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy'