': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'briefing', '_id': 'nyt://article/d75f995e-43ea-5b6b-8e49-401aeffac502', 'word_count': 1122, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d75f995e-43ea-5b6b-8e49-401aeffac502'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Indiana’s depiction of the letters L, O, V and E was one of the best-known images of the 20th century, widely reproduced but also widely imitated.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/21/obituaries/robert-indiana-love-pop-art-dies.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Indiana’s depiction of the letters L, O, V and E was one of the best-known images of the 20th century, widely reproduced but also widely imitated.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Robert Indiana, the Pop artist whose bold rendering of the word “love” became one of the most recognizable artworks of the 20th century, gracing hundreds of prints, paintings and sculptures, some 330 million postage stamps that he authorized and countless tchotchkes that he did not, died on Saturday at his home in Vinalhaven, Me. He was 89.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/22/obituaries/22INDIANAOBIT1-print/merlin_138484623_a9a65bd8-b4d2-4c06-93e5-1d8fb7b35832-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/22/obituaries/22INDIANAOBIT1-print/merlin_138484623_a9a65bd8-b4d2-4c06-93e5-1d8fb7b35832-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/22/obituaries/22INDIANAOBIT1-print/merlin_138484623_a9a65bd8-b4d2-4c06-93e5-1d8fb7b35832-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/22/obituaries/2