': 'Jeff Stillman makes us look up.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you are new to solving the New York Times Crossword, you might not be aware that some of our constructors are also artists. Not only do they create these puzzles for our solving pleasure, but occasionally, they make them with artwork inside. I’ve said it before and I’ll say it again: Not all crossword puzzles are mere two-dimensional grids created to test your intellectual abilities. Who would want to subject themselves to that every single day? Crossword puzzles are games, and games are meant to be fun. Sometimes they can even be beautiful.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/22/crosswords/22wordplay-ursa/merlin_10993383_091a3ba5-b292-4cd0-a9a0-b67beaff812d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 455, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/22/crosswords/22wordplay-ursa/merlin_10993383_091a3ba5-b292-4cd0-a9a0-b67beaff812d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 455}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/22/crosswords/22wordplay-ursa/merlin_10993383_091a3ba5-b292-4cd0-a9a0-b67beaff812d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 776, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/22/crosswords/22wordplay-ursa/merlin_10993383_091a3ba5-b292-4cd0-a9a0-b67beaff812d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 878, 'width': 1158, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/22/crosswords/22wordplay-ursa/merlin_10993383_091a3ba5-b292-4cd0-a9a0-b67beaff812d-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thu