News', '_id': 'nyt://article/99213117-394e-5c02-a6b7-e8b6437c63e0', 'word_count': 678, 'uri': 'nyt://article/99213117-394e-5c02-a6b7-e8b6437c63e0'}, {'abstract': 'One lesson of New York City Ballet’s Jerome Robbins celebration concerned his musicality, which often points to parts of the score left undanced.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/22/arts/dance/new-york-city-ballet-robbins-100.html', 'snippet': 'One lesson of New York City Ballet’s Jerome Robbins celebration concerned his musicality, which often points to parts of the score left undanced.', 'lead_paragraph': 'All too soon, New York City Ballet’s “Robbins 100” season is over. Its 20 ballets proved hurdles that the dancers and musicians were happy to leap over in glowing form — a glow shared by the ballets themselves. Jerome Robbins, even in his most cartoon-fun or most small-scale creations, has largeness of spirit.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/23/arts/23robbins-two2/merlin_138226122_7475e206-b4e5-4a83-885a-f7a3f4809175-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/23/arts/23robbins-two2/merlin_138226122_7475e206-b4e5-4a83-885a-f7a3f4809175-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/23/arts/23robbins-two2/merlin_138226122_7475e206-b4e5-4a83-885a-f7a3f4809175-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/23/arts/23robbins-two2/merlin_138226122_7475e206-b4e5-4a83-885a-f7a3f4809175-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name':