irstname': 'Zz', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Packer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/adb1245b-f939-5d51-a666-c1d8800bfe9f', 'word_count': 1561, 'uri': 'nyt://article/adb1245b-f939-5d51-a666-c1d8800bfe9f'}, {'abstract': 'Mr. Murphy, the TV creator, and Ms. Mock, the transgender activist, discuss the new FX series about the vogue ball scene in ’80s New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/23/arts/television/pose-ryan-murphy-janet-mock.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Murphy, the TV creator, and Ms. Mock, the transgender activist, discuss the new FX series about the vogue ball scene in ’80s New York.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I personally can do better,” the TV creator Ryan Murphy said back in 2016, when he launched Half, his initiative for hiring women, people of color and L.G.B.T. folks for half of the directing jobs on his shows.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/27/arts/27table1/merlin_137535522_8f44def8-afb7-4074-9fde-0a0efab49475-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/27/arts/27table1/merlin_137535522_8f44def8-afb7-4074-9fde-0a0efab49475-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/27/arts/27table1/merlin_137535522_8f44def8-afb7-4074-9fde-0a0efab49475-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/27/arts/27table1/merlin_137535522_8f44def8-afb7-4074-9fde-0a0efab49475-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367