ted, also describes Mr. Kim’s brother as a fan of Eric Clapton and portrays tensions within the Kim dynasty.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/23/world/asia/north-korea-kim-jong-un-book.html', 'snippet': 'A memoir by Thae Yong-ho, a senior diplomat who defected, also describes Mr. Kim’s brother as a fan of Eric Clapton and portrays tensions within the Kim dynasty.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEOUL, South Korea — The bloody purges by the North Korean leader, Kim Jong-un, of his country’s elites and the execution of his uncle were driven in part by his feelings about his mother, whose background is a tightly guarded secret in the country, according to a new book by a senior diplomat who defected.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/23/world/00korea-defector-1sub/merlin_138123717_01f5617e-ea26-46d0-a632-b25492ed569c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 405, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/23/world/00korea-defector-1sub/merlin_138123717_01f5617e-ea26-46d0-a632-b25492ed569c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 405}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/23/world/00korea-defector-1sub/merlin_138123717_01f5617e-ea26-46d0-a632-b25492ed569c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/23/world/00korea-defector-1sub/merlin_138123717_01f5617e-ea26-46d0-a632-b25492ed569c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1381, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/23/world/00korea-def