tract': 'Yes, he explored ugly territory. But few have done so with such wit, fearlessness and emotional acuity.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/23/opinion/philip-roth-toxic-masculinity.html', 'snippet': 'Yes, he explored ugly territory. But few have done so with such wit, fearlessness and emotional acuity.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I recently heard a young, successful writer admit that though she knew it was wrong, she had a place in her heart for Philip Roth. One of the greatest American novelists of the past several decades (along with Don DeLillo and Toni Morrison), Mr. Roth died on Tuesday, and like many readers of fiction I’ve been thinking about his legacy, including what we might mean when we say it’s “wrong” to like him.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '31', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/23/opinion/23Lipsyte/23Lipsyte-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 416, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/23/opinion/23Lipsyte/23Lipsyte-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 416}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/23/opinion/23Lipsyte/23Lipsyte-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 710, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/23/opinion/23Lipsyte/23Lipsyte-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1420, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/23/opinion/23Lipsyte/23Lipsyte-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/23/opinion/23Lipsyte/23