1}, {'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Scull', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'briefing', '_id': 'nyt://article/8e32b9c1-9613-530d-912c-957087cb321b', 'word_count': 1091, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8e32b9c1-9613-530d-912c-957087cb321b'}, {'abstract': 'She and other contemporaries held weekly curbside protests in New York for nearly nine years and was arrested twice when they took on Times Square military recruiters.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/23/obituaries/joan-wile-grandmothers-against-the-war-in-iraq-dies-at-86.html', 'snippet': 'She and other contemporaries held weekly curbside protests in New York for nearly nine years and was arrested twice when they took on Times Square military recruiters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Joan Wile, a former songwriter and actress who in her 70s weaponized the power of grandmotherhood by organizing a nine-year-long weekly vigil by fellow venerable protesters against the war in Iraq, died on May 4 in Nanuet, N.Y. She was 86.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/24/obituaries/24WILE3/merlin_138575376_4b6ed113-5b61-44f0-9bb0-1a6f7c38f117-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/24/obituaries/24WILE3/merlin_138575376_4b6ed113-5b61-44f0-9bb0-1a6f7c38f117-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/24/obituaries/24WILE3/merlin_138575376_4b6ed113-5b61-44f0-9bb0-1a6f7c38f117-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 453, 'width': 604, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/24/obituaries/24WILE3/merlin_138575376_4b6ed113-5b61-44f0-9bb0-1a6f7c38f117-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 453, 'width': 604, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/24/obituaries/24WILE3/24WILE3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/24/obituaries/24WILE3/24WILE3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/24/obituaries/24WILE3/24WILE3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Joan Wile, a Grandmother Against the War in Iraq, Dies at 86', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Joan Wile, 86, a Grandmother Against the War in Iraq', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wile, Joan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Grandmothers Against the War', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Iraq War (2003-11)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grandparents', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-05-23T21:58:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Obituaries', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Roberts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Roberts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/f36ecc2a-9dce-56d2-b411-c78799eef74d', 'word_count': 1013, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f36ecc2a-9dce-56d2-b411-c78799eef74d'}, {'abstract': 'His offhand comments about writing stick with me almost as much as his novels.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/23/opinion/nathan-englander-philip-roth-and-the-whale.html', 'snippet': 'His offhand comments about writing stick with me almost as much as his novels.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I remember when Philip Roth told me he’d stopped writing fiction. He was talking with my wife and me, and — looking honestly happy and relaxed about his new situation — he said, “Now I can have a glass of orange juice in the morning and read the newspaper.” And I remember thinking, You could have had your orange juice after “Portnoy’s Complaint” or “The Ghostwriter,” that you probably earned at least a scan of the A-section by book 10 or 12 or 14.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/23/opinion/23Englander/23Englander-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/23/opinion/23Englander/23Englander-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/23/opinion/23Englander/23Englander-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/23/opinion/23Englander/23Englander-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/23/opinion/23Englander/23Englander-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subT