This methodical and efficient cabin-in-the-woods horror movie subjects college graduates to a zombie infection.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/24/movies/feral-review.html', 'snippet': 'This methodical and efficient cabin-in-the-woods horror movie subjects college graduates to a zombie infection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ever since Sam Raimi introduced us to “The Evil Dead” almost four decades ago, the humble cabin in the woods has served as splatter central for a slew of young horror-movie directors. Within its isolated, frugally furnished walls, dozens of innocent campers have been variously subjected to flesh-eating viruses, ravening cannibals or unwisely resurrected demons, all providing ample excuse for flaying and freaking out.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/22/arts/feral1/merlin_138359013_52b878c2-8d16-40c5-bac2-037c7d235fd9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 316, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/22/arts/feral1/merlin_138359013_52b878c2-8d16-40c5-bac2-037c7d235fd9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 316}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/22/arts/feral1/merlin_138359013_52b878c2-8d16-40c5-bac2-037c7d235fd9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 540, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/22/arts/feral1/merlin_138359013_52b878c2-8d16-40c5-bac2-037c7d235fd9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/22/arts/feral1/feral1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/22/arts/feral1/feral1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/22/arts/feral1/feral1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Deep in the Woods, Something ‘Feral’ Stirs', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Feral', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Feral (Movie)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Young, Mark H', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-05-24T11:00:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeannette Catsoulis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeannette', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Catsoulis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/212d1f28-a072-5cd3-add0-ac9b45a25077', 'word_count': 272, 'uri': 'nyt://article/212d1f28-a072-5cd3-add0-ac9b45a25077'}, {'abstract': 'John Cameron Mitchell’s loony romantic comedy encourages young love to bloom in the soil of an alien visitation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/24/movies/how-to-talk-to-girls-at-parties-review.html', 'snippet': 'John Cameron Mitchell’s loony romantic comedy encourages young love to bloom in the soil of an alien visitation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s something endearingly childlike about “How to Talk to Girls at Parties” that goes a long way toward compensating for its inarguable daftness. Directed by John Cameron Mitchell (loosely adapting a Neil Gaiman short