act': 'Once known just for flashy offense, D’Antoni has the Rockets on the verge of the finals. His brother Dan is even considering coming to a game.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/24/sports/mike-dantoni-houston-rockets-nba-playoffs.html', 'snippet': 'Once known just for flashy offense, D’Antoni has the Rockets on the verge of the finals. His brother Dan is even considering coming to a game.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A serendipitous stretch of N.B.A. schedule in March allowed Mike D’Antoni to be in the building when his brother Dan coached Marshall University to the school’s first N.C.A.A. tournament berth in 31 years. Mike D’Antoni’s Houston Rockets happened to be in Dallas on the same weekend that Dan’s Thundering Herd won the Conference USA championship game in nearby Frisco, Texas.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/25/sports/25steinweb1/merlin_137620824_7a2f9cf6-bbd3-469f-9663-ed0176d842af-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/25/sports/25steinweb1/merlin_137620824_7a2f9cf6-bbd3-469f-9663-ed0176d842af-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/25/sports/25steinweb1/merlin_137620824_7a2f9cf6-bbd3-469f-9663-ed0176d842af-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/25/sports/25steinweb1/merlin_137620824_7a2f9cf6-bbd3-469f-9663-ed0176d842af-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': Non