,000 on average in New York City’s most expensive condo buildings.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The new super-skinny 432 Park is one of the five most expensive condo buildings in New York City, according to the most recent CityRealty 100, an index of Manhattan’s priciest condominiums. Some older buildings made the top five as well, including the 2008 Trump International, at 1 Central Park West, which has been appreciating in value.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/27/realestate/27calculator-1526672868411/27calculator-1526672868411-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 990, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/27/realestate/27calculator-1526672868411/27calculator-1526672868411-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 990}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/27/realestate/27calculator-1526672868411/27calculator-1526672868411-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 621, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/27/realestate/27calculator-1526672868411/27calculator-1526672868411-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/27/realestate/27calculator-1526672868411/27calculator-1526672868411-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/27/realestate/27calculator-1526672868411/27calculator-1526672868411-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subty