ole': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bf46aeec-d1b9-5c16-b3fa-10f99b153146', 'word_count': 1691, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bf46aeec-d1b9-5c16-b3fa-10f99b153146'}, {'abstract': 'A categorized collection of the short, accessible, image-driven posts we published during the 2017-18 school year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/24/learning/over-150-picture-prompts-for-creative-personal-argumentative-and-explanatory-writing.html', 'snippet': 'A categorized collection of the short, accessible, image-driven posts we published during the 2017-18 school year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every day on our site we publish a Picture Prompt — a short, accessible, image-driven post that uses a photograph or illustration from The Times to inspire student writing. These writing prompts invite students to create short stories and poems, share experiences from their lives, tell us what they think an image is saying, weigh in on hot-button issues, and discover, question and explain scientific phenomena.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/opinion/sunday/17grant-LNPP/17grant-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 279, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2016/01/15/opinion/sunday/17grant-LNPP/17grant-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 279}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/opinion/sunday/17grant-LNPP/17grant-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 476, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2016/01/15/opinion/sunday/17grant-LNPP/17grant-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 837, 'width': 1801, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJ