fca995afd9'}, {'abstract': 'A show devoted to his large-scale black-and-white works on canvas and paper will be on view in September at the Paul Kasmin Gallery in Chelsea.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/24/arts/design/stuart-davis-paul-kasmin.html', 'snippet': 'A show devoted to his large-scale black-and-white works on canvas and paper will be on view in September at the Paul Kasmin Gallery in Chelsea.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Stuart Davis, a leading American modernist who died in 1964, is best known for his boldly colorful paintings. They reduced consumer products and billboards into hard-edge shapes and dynamic rhythms inspired by street life and jazz. But his art theories were rooted in drawing, not color, according to Earl Davis, the artist’s only child, who oversees his father’s estate.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/25/arts/design/25stuartdavis/25stuartdavis-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 473, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/25/arts/design/25stuartdavis/25stuartdavis-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 473}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/25/arts/design/25stuartdavis/25stuartdavis-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 807, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/25/arts/design/25stuartdavis/25stuartdavis-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 1523, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/25/arts/design/25stuartdavis/25stuartdavis-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width