07-afe0-4fa3a5e55367'}, {'abstract': 'Laws dating from the colonial era have long denied people in the region basic rights and authorized the use of collective punishment against tribes or families.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/24/world/asia/pakistan-tribal-areas-rights.html', 'snippet': 'Laws dating from the colonial era have long denied people in the region basic rights and authorized the use of collective punishment against tribes or families.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ISLAMABAD, Pakistan — The lower house of Pakistan’s Parliament overwhelmingly adopted a constitutional amendment on Thursday giving equal rights to millions of people in its restive northwestern tribal regions and ending a much-criticized legacy of British colonial law.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/25/world/25pakistan/merlin_138616749_627e7931-f2c8-41e7-8479-a06822e64c2f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/25/world/25pakistan/merlin_138616749_627e7931-f2c8-41e7-8479-a06822e64c2f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/25/world/25pakistan/merlin_138616749_627e7931-f2c8-41e7-8479-a06822e64c2f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/25/world/25pakistan/merlin_138616749_627e7931-f2c8-41e7-8479-a06822e64c2f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/25/world/25pa