 in August, could hinder university efforts to attract the brightest minds from overseas.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Trump administration plans to crack down on international students and visitors who overstay their visas, stoking fears in the higher education community that President Trump’s aggressive immigration policies will hinder university efforts to attract the brightest minds from overseas.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Trump’s Crackdown on Students Who Overstay Visas Rattles Higher Education', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trump’s Crackdown on Students Who Overstay Visas Rattles Colleges', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreign Students (in US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Citizenship and Immigration Services (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Study and Teaching', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-05-24T22:43:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erica L. Green', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erica', 'middlename': 'L.', 'lastname': 'Green', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d9dd8bf9-5732-56ee-b924-05dff8b1a172', 'word_count': 1217, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d9dd8bf9-5732-56ee