ns and Annulments', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Prus, Eric I', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hasidism', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Footsteps (Nonprofit)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Legal Assistance Group', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rockland County (NY)', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-05-25T09:00:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metropolitan', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sharon Otterman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sharon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Otterman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ca84bda5-0b13-54ae-a243-5fcae44f80ff', 'word_count': 2387, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ca84bda5-0b13-54ae-a243-5fcae44f80ff'}, {'abstract': 'Sweet-and-sour humor permeates Dorothea Benton Frank’s latest Southern comedy of manners, “By Invitation Only.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/25/books/review/dorothea-benton-frank-by-invitation-only-best-sellers.html', 'snippet': 'Sweet-and-sour humor permeates Dorothea Benton Frank’s latest Southern comedy of manners, “By Invitation Only.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'TO LOVE AND TO CHERISH “I’m the one you want to sit next to when things are dull,” says Dorothea Benton Frank, whose new novel, “By Invitation Only,” debuts at No. 4 this week. “My old sweet friend Pat Conroy once said to me, you know, you’re funny on the page,” she recalls. “And I said, yes, I am. I know there are those who say humor diminishes the literary value of a story, but I think humor is desperately needed in every corner of this world. Desperately. Humor is a mighty powerful tool when correctly applied.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '64', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/books/review/03-BKS-LIST/03-BKS-LIST-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/06/03/books/review/03-BKS-LIST/03-BKS-LIST-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/books/review/03-BKS-LIST/03-BKS-LIST-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/books/review/03-BKS-LIST/03-BKS-LIST-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1050, 'width': 1050, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/books/review/03-BKS-LIST/03-BKS-LIST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/06/03/books/review/03-BKS-LIST/03-BKS-LIST-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/books/review/03-BKS-LIST/03-BKS-LIST-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘I’m the One You Want to Sit Next to When Things Are Dull’', 'kicker': 'Inside the List', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name