, enlivened with music and dance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/25/theater/fatherland-simon-stephens-karl-hyde-scott-graham.html', 'snippet': '“Fatherland,” now playing in London, brings together interviews about what it means to be a parent, enlivened with music and dance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — In February 2015, three men took a road trip back to their hometowns. Their aim was to make an ambitious, genre-defying theater show about fatherhood that they would call “Fatherland.” But it became something more personal. As well as reckoning with what it means to be a dad, they would have to to face up to their reasons for leaving home in the first place.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/10/arts/10fatherland-print3/merlin_138546072_cea26192-92a8-4942-8b61-1bc7cd74773b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/06/10/arts/10fatherland-print3/merlin_138546072_cea26192-92a8-4942-8b61-1bc7cd74773b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/10/arts/10fatherland-print3/merlin_138546072_cea26192-92a8-4942-8b61-1bc7cd74773b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/10/arts/10fatherland-print3/merlin_138546072_cea26192-92a8-4942-8b61-1bc7cd74773b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/10/arts/10fatherland-print3/26fatherland3-thumbStandard.j