96, 'uri': 'nyt://article/265f7508-c45e-5828-8dfb-35bd90b8ee3c'}, {'abstract': 'A student opened fire at a middle school on Friday morning. “Here we go again, and it’s just really, really, really unfortunate,” an Indiana police official said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/25/us/noblesville-indiana-shooting.html', 'snippet': 'A student opened fire at a middle school on Friday morning. “Here we go again, and it’s just really, really, really unfortunate,” an Indiana police official said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A student at an Indiana middle school barged into a class on Friday morning wielding two handguns and firing shots. A teacher and another student were wounded. The boy with the guns, the authorities say, was subdued, then arrested. And on a sunny day that began with the promise of a holiday weekend, yet another American city was left to cope with classroom bloodshed.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/26/us/26indiana/merlin_138660834_dd1b6a39-e941-455b-837e-1cf131e1d9b0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 376, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/26/us/26indiana/merlin_138660834_dd1b6a39-e941-455b-837e-1cf131e1d9b0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 376}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/26/us/26indiana/merlin_138660834_dd1b6a39-e941-455b-837e-1cf131e1d9b0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 641, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/26/us/26indiana/merlin_138660834_dd1b6a39-e941-455b-837e-1cf131e1d9b0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1283, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'capti