: 'nyt://article/dac976e5-2b2a-59bd-8a86-274f78ff5c39'}, {'abstract': 'Vladimir Putin hosted leaders of France and Japan in his native city, where they showed unity in their criticism of President Trump’s recent moves.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/25/world/europe/putin-france-japan-trump.html', 'snippet': 'Vladimir Putin hosted leaders of France and Japan in his native city, where they showed unity in their criticism of President Trump’s recent moves.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ST. PETERSBURG, Russia — The president of France spoke of an “erroneous decision.” Japan’s Prime Minister lamented disruptions to trade. The head of the International Monetary Fund said recent foreign policy positions were “not the right way to go.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/26/world/26russia1/merlin_138665427_4f1b99f6-6eed-49bd-865e-86f48688d750-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/26/world/26russia1/merlin_138665427_4f1b99f6-6eed-49bd-865e-86f48688d750-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/26/world/26russia1/merlin_138665427_4f1b99f6-6eed-49bd-865e-86f48688d750-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/26/world/26russia1/merlin_138665427_4f1b99f6-6eed-49bd-865e-86f48688d750-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/26/world/26russia1/26russia1-thum