ed Nations warned.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/27/world/asia/afghanistan-drought-war.html', 'snippet': 'Severe shortages of rainfall across the country could leave up to two million more people without food, the United Nations warned.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KABUL, Afghanistan — Afghanistan, already torn by decades of intensifying violence, is grappling with a drought in two-thirds of the country that could lead to severe food shortages for up to two million more people, the United Nations has warned.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/28/world/28afghanistan-sub/merlin_138509739_030675f5-faf7-4256-94b3-fb742a1d2300-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 406, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/28/world/28afghanistan-sub/merlin_138509739_030675f5-faf7-4256-94b3-fb742a1d2300-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 406}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/28/world/28afghanistan-sub/merlin_138509739_030675f5-faf7-4256-94b3-fb742a1d2300-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 692, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/28/world/28afghanistan-sub/merlin_138509739_030675f5-faf7-4256-94b3-fb742a1d2300-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1385, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/28/world/28afghanistan-sub/28afghanistan-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/28/world/28afghanistan-sub/28afghanis