 'uri': 'nyt://article/4c23fc4f-92a2-5145-91a4-08a3e54778aa'}, {'abstract': 'The men, who served in Iraq and Afghanistan, are traveling the country and building political networks as they find a place in a party top-heavy with leaders in their 60s and 70s.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/28/us/politics/democrats-veterans-kander-moulton.html', 'snippet': 'The men, who served in Iraq and Afghanistan, are traveling the country and building political networks as they find a place in a party top-heavy with leaders in their 60s and 70s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ADEL, Iowa — The assembled at the Country Lane Lodge looked a lot like the typical Iowa voter: old and white. But the Democrats of Dallas County who had gathered for their spring fund-raiser were brought to their feet by a lean man from Missouri dressed in standard-issue millennial garb: suit jacket, bluejeans, narrow tie and two-tone half boots.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/29/us/politics/29dc-audition-print/merlin_137428653_82bbc978-615b-4c00-a49e-f9defd771b82-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/29/us/politics/29dc-audition-print/merlin_137428653_82bbc978-615b-4c00-a49e-f9defd771b82-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/29/us/politics/29dc-audition-print/merlin_137428653_82bbc978-615b-4c00-a49e-f9defd771b82-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/29/us/politics/29dc-audition-print/merlin_137428653_82bbc978-615b-4c00-a49e-f9defd771b82-superJumbo.jpg'