m-elections.html', 'snippet': 'After years of being relegated to the sidelines during national campaigns, California has found itself at the heart of the Democratic battle to take control of Congress. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sign up for California Today for the latest news on the June 5 primary and more here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/30/us/30midterm_ca/merlin_134569568_ca89b052-a036-4aed-856e-75763ceed021-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 417, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/30/us/30midterm_ca/merlin_134569568_ca89b052-a036-4aed-856e-75763ceed021-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 417}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/30/us/30midterm_ca/merlin_134569568_ca89b052-a036-4aed-856e-75763ceed021-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 711, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/30/us/30midterm_ca/merlin_134569568_ca89b052-a036-4aed-856e-75763ceed021-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1423, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/30/us/30midterm_ca/30midterm_ca-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/30/us/30midterm_ca/30midterm_ca-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/30/us/30midterm_ca/30midterm_ca-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge