anada.html', 'snippet': 'The journalist on mass shootings, not believing in prisons and if Donald Trump has gotten in his 10,000 hours of practice for presidential greatness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You just started Season 3 of your podcast, “Revisionist History,” which explores, as you put it, “the overlooked and the misunderstood.” What’s the most widely misunderstood event in history? Oh, my God. I have no idea. If I knew that, I’d do an episode on it. I think that the premise of the show is that everything is misunderstood in some way, and that there is great virtue in coming to a subject late. In a media culture that is so obsessed with being first, I would like to be last.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '62', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/magazine/03mag-Talk2/03mag-Talk2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/06/03/magazine/03mag-Talk2/03mag-Talk2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/magazine/03mag-Talk2/03mag-Talk2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/magazine/03mag-Talk2/03mag-Talk2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/magazine/03mag-Talk2/03mag-Talk2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/06/03/magazine/03mag-Talk2/03mag-Talk2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thum