ng their views of what counts as art.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/30/magazine/who-gets-to-decide-what-belongs-in-the-canon.html', 'snippet': 'With cultural hierarchies under reconstruction, traditionalists and dissenters alike are frantically defending their views of what counts as art.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sometimes, it’s not enough to love something. You have to take that thing — album, author, song, movie, show — and do more than love it. It needs to be placed beyond mere love. You need to take that thing, wrap it in plastic or put it on a pedestal. You need to dome it under a force field so that other people’s grubby hands, opinions and inferior fandoms can’t stain or disrespect it. You need not only to certify it but also to forestall decertification. Basically, you need to make it “canon.”', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/magazine/03mag-FirstWords-image1/03mag-FirstWords-image1-articleLarge.png', 'height': 531, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/06/03/magazine/03mag-FirstWords-image1/03mag-FirstWords-image1-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 531}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/magazine/03mag-FirstWords-image1/03mag-FirstWords-image1-jumbo.png', 'height': 906, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/magazine/03mag-FirstWords-image1/03mag-FirstWords-image1-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1812, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03