e bedroom, she struggled to follow. She held onto the banister with both hands. Lifting her legs was real work. She felt as if weights were attached to her feet. How did she get to be this tired?', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/magazine/03mag-diagnosis-image-1/03mag-diagnosis-image-1-articleLarge.png', 'height': 536, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/06/03/magazine/03mag-diagnosis-image-1/03mag-diagnosis-image-1-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 536}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/magazine/03mag-diagnosis-image-1/03mag-diagnosis-image-1-jumbo.png', 'height': 914, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/magazine/03mag-diagnosis-image-1/03mag-diagnosis-image-1-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1828, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/magazine/03mag-diagnosis-image-1/03mag-diagnosis-image-1-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/06/03/magazine/03mag-diagnosis-image-1/03mag-diagnosis-image-1-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/magazine/03mag-diagnosis-image-1/03mag-diagnosis-image-1-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main'