 (and aches) in depictions of new mothers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A few weeks ago, I was watching a new show, me and the laptop scrunched into the corner of the sofa. It was late at night and everyone else had gone to sleep, when rounding the second episode, my sympathetic nervous system started working unpaid overtime: short breath, tensed muscles, pounding heart, the whole hypothalamic-pituitary-adrenal shebang.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/arts/03MOM-TV-ILLO/merlin_138671088_02326c3e-33ed-4c4b-964e-ed34d53b119d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 499, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/06/03/arts/03MOM-TV-ILLO/merlin_138671088_02326c3e-33ed-4c4b-964e-ed34d53b119d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 499}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/arts/03MOM-TV-ILLO/merlin_138671088_02326c3e-33ed-4c4b-964e-ed34d53b119d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 851, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/arts/03MOM-TV-ILLO/merlin_138671088_02326c3e-33ed-4c4b-964e-ed34d53b119d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1702, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/03/arts/03MOM-TV-ILLO/merlin_138671088_02326c3e-33ed-4c4b-964e-ed34d53b119d-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/06/03/arts/03MOM-TV-ILLO/merlin_138671088_02326c3e-33ed-4c4b-964e-ed34d53b119d-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailhe