 architecture and lush vegetation, this often overlooked California city — the photogenic backdrop of the movie “Lady Bird” — has much to offer the weekend visitor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/31/travel/what-to-do-in-sacramento.html', 'snippet': 'With its thriving cultural scene, striking architecture and lush vegetation, this often overlooked California city — the photogenic backdrop of the movie “Lady Bird” — has much to offer the weekend visitor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As a travel destination, California’s capital gets no respect. Despite sitting at the confluence of two impressive rivers, with sprawling shade trees that make much of the city feel like a leafy urban park, Sacramento has a misplaced reputation as a lowly, unattractive place. But the state’s oldest incorporated city —  founded in 1849, the year before California joined the union —  remains a lush oasis of bougainvillea and palms, prolific fruit trees and mighty oaks. ', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/10/travel/10Hours-Sacramento5/merlin_136185090_a507a3a7-60c5-440c-a476-83b879165575-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/06/10/travel/10Hours-Sacramento5/merlin_136185090_a507a3a7-60c5-440c-a476-83b879165575-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/10/travel/10Hours-Sacramento5/merlin_136185090_a507a3a7-60c5-440c-a476-83b879165575-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/10/travel/10Hours-Sacramento5/merlin_136185090_a507a3a7-60c5-440c-a476-83b