: 'Sacramento has it all — natural beauty to explore, art and theater to enjoy and delicious food on virtually every corner. You’ll want to spend some time outdoors, so grab these essentials for your trip.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/31/travel/what-to-pack-for-a-trip-to-sacramento.html', 'snippet': 'Sacramento has it all — natural beauty to explore, art and theater to enjoy and delicious food on virtually every corner. You’ll want to spend some time outdoors, so grab these essentials for your trip.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From craft beer and taco stands to art, theater and enough coffee shops to keep you fueled up while you bike around town, Sacramento has tons to offer. We walk you through all of it in our local guide, but before you go, grab these essentials for your visit.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/10/travel/10hours-sacramento7/10hours-sacramento7-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/06/10/travel/10hours-sacramento7/10hours-sacramento7-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/10/travel/10hours-sacramento7/10hours-sacramento7-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/10/travel/10hours-sacramento7/10hours-sacramento7-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/10/travel/10hours-sacramento7/10hours-sacramento7-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 