ight to equal protection.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/31/us/defense-department-sued-hiv-policy.html', 'snippet': 'Lawyers for Army Sgt. Nick Harrison, who has H.I.V., argue that the military’s policies discriminate against people with the virus and violate the constitutional right to equal protection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Army Sgt. Nick Harrison learned he was infected with H.I.V. six years ago, but the once fatal diagnosis has barely changed his routine at work or at home because he keeps the virus in check with a once-a-day pill. The only thing H.I.V. crippled was his military career.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/01/us/01hiv-print/merlin_138882315_051b6d35-3640-4fe6-819a-43f68c3d7924-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/06/01/us/01hiv-print/merlin_138882315_051b6d35-3640-4fe6-819a-43f68c3d7924-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/01/us/01hiv-print/merlin_138882315_051b6d35-3640-4fe6-819a-43f68c3d7924-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/01/us/01hiv-print/merlin_138882315_051b6d35-3640-4fe6-819a-43f68c3d7924-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/06/01/us/01hiv-print/merlin_138882315_051b6d35-3640-4fe6-819a-43f68c3d7924-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStanda