s-for-making-me-feel-good-this-morning-readers-respond-to-the-compton-cowboys.html', 'snippet': 'I first learned that there were horses in Compton, Calif., when my mother and I would go shopping at the Compton Fashion Center in the early 1990s. Years later, I wanted to see if they were still around.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I first learned that there were horses in Compton, Calif., at about the age of 6, in the early 1990s, when my mother and I would go shopping at the Compton Fashion Center. We lived about five minutes away, and I’d sometimes see black men on horses at various intersections waiting for the light to change, particularly on Sundays. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/22/us/oakImage-1527006794213/oakImage-1527006794213-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/22/us/oakImage-1527006794213/oakImage-1527006794213-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/22/us/oakImage-1527006794213/oakImage-1527006794213-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/22/us/oakImage-1527006794213/oakImage-1527006794213-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/22/us/oakImage-1527006794213/oakImage-1527006794213-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/05/22/us/oakImage-1527006794213/oakImage-1527006794213-thu