acdc550fbb'}, {'abstract': 'Dinesh D’Souza does not deserve a presidential pardon.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/05/31/opinion/donald-trump-dinesh-dsouza-pardon.html', 'snippet': 'Dinesh D’Souza does not deserve a presidential pardon.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During Barack Obama’s administration, the conservative author and activist Dinesh D’Souza wrote a book, “Obama’s America,” full of gross speculations about the sex life of the president’s mother, Stanley Ann Dunham, who was a pioneering anthropologist. “Ann’s sexual adventuring may seem a little surprising in view of the fact that she was a large woman who kept getting larger,” wrote D’Souza. He described her as a “playgirl” who used “her American background and economic and social power to purchase the romantic attention of third-world men.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/31/opinion/31goldbergWeb/merlin_87641797_24c856a4-ae2d-4a6e-ab1f-ded62e62ad1f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/05/31/opinion/31goldbergWeb/merlin_87641797_24c856a4-ae2d-4a6e-ab1f-ded62e62ad1f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/31/opinion/31goldbergWeb/merlin_87641797_24c856a4-ae2d-4a6e-ab1f-ded62e62ad1f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/05/31/opinion/31goldbergWeb/merlin_87641797_24c856a4-ae2d-4a6e-ab1f-ded62e62ad1f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'ur